  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-bed-variants.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Bed-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h1>更多床的变体</h1>\n<p>如果没有用与床周围木板相匹配的木材制成的床，人们如何能舒适地入睡呢？现在这种情况已成历史。除了常见的橡木之外，所有 16 种可能的床颜色现在也每种都提供了所有木材类型。</p>\n<p>此外，还有两种灵感分别来自<b>竹筏</b>和<b>竹块</b>及其<b>去皮变体</b>的竹子床新变体。（感谢 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fRedupro\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Redupro</a> 提供创意和初始设计。）</p>\n<p>在版本 <strong>2.0.0</strong> 及更高版本中，<em>更多床的变体</em>（包括原版床）使用常规的<b>方块渲染</b>而非<b>方块实体渲染</b>，从而提升了性能并允许资源包添加自定义模型。如下所示，模组已内置了两个资源包：<br>\n<strong>更多<b>带枕头</b>的床变体</strong>及其<b><b>连接</b></b>变体。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Bed-Variants/pres/cf_desc_banner.webp\" alt=\"展示在木板床上摆放的床 - 并列展示不同的内置资源包\"></p>\n<h2>为 Minecraft 添加了 208 张新床。</h2>\n<hr>\n<h1>兼容 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a> 1.3.0+ 的方块替换功能：</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/kd7rj.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n从小草原村庄房屋的窗户向外望去，可以看到武器匠的入口：我们可以看到，屋内不再是<b>橡木（红色）床</b>和<b>橡木工作台</b>，武器匠处也不再是<b>橡木火把</b>和<b>深色橡木砂轮</b>，而是游戏现在生成的村庄中包含<b><b>金合欢（红色）床</b></b>、<b><b>金合欢工作台</b></b>（来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-crafting-tables-lieonlion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多工作台 (MCT)</a>）、<b><b>金合欢火把</b></b>（来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多火把变体</a>）以及<b><b>金合欢砂轮</b></b>（来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-grindstone-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多砂轮变体</a>）。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
